      "id": "p0010-b002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Have you ever played a video game, watched a movie, or read a book and wondered what it was like in its original language? Or have you ever wondered how your favorite game, movie, or book sounds in a different language? Welcome to the world of Legends of Localization!",
