      "id": "p0010-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In this book, we'll take a detailed look at the popular American video game known as Undertale. We'll compare the original English version of the game with its official Japanese release. We'll also look at some of the translation challenges involved, and the solutions that were used to overcome them.",
