        "text": "What \"localization\" is and how it differs from translation Undertale's history and the inspirations behind the game Undertale's localization process as seen from the inside Common problems and mistakes in entertainment localization How culture and language shape a game's localization and vice-versa How unofficial, volunteer-made localizations and official localizations interact, how they differ, and what they mean to fans",
