      "id": "p0010-b006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Some of this might sound like dry, boring academic material, but don't worry - it'll be a genuinely fun and enlightening journey. After all, how do bad knock knock jokes and skeleton puns even work in Japanese? Do they just get lost in translation? Let's find out!",
