      "id": "p0010-b008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Although this book analyzes the English and Japanese versions of Undertale and touches on topics that will surely delight Undertale fans, it's also been designed with general audiences in mind. Everything in this book is explained in clear, simple English for readers who know nothing about Undertale, video games, the Japanese language, or translation.",
