      "id": "p0010-b012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Undertale is full of surprises, branching story routes, and endings. Every playthrough feels unique and memorable - especially your first one. For this reason, spoilers can greatly affect the gameplay experience.",
